xFit</span></a></li><li style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd"><a href="#三种渐变" style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd"><span style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd">三种渐变</span></a></li><li style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd"><a href="#行内图标对齐" style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd"><span style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd">行内图标对齐</span></a></li><li style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd"><a href="#圆角背景与子树裁剪" style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd"><span style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd">圆角背景与子树裁剪</span></a></li></ul></nav></starlight-toc><script data-cfasync="false" type="module" src="/_astro/TableOfContents.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Csloo1VZ.js"></script></div></div></div></aside><div class="main-pane astro-aak7uwzb"><main data-pagefind-body class="astro-7jrn6cqt" lang="zh-CN" dir="ltr"><div class="content-panel astro-vdatg63d"><div class="sl-container astro-vdatg63d"><h1 id="_top" class="astro-grsobg4o">参数效果对比</h1></div></div><div class="content-panel astro-vdatg63d"><div class="sl-container astro-vdatg63d"><div class="sl-markdown-content"><article><p>以下图片由本地 Snapshot 实际渲染，不是概念示意图。每组固定其他条件，只改变指定参数；字体环境仍可能改变文本度量。完整业务模板见<a href="/guides/examples/">模板示例</a>。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="代码怎么运行" __collectHeading="true">代码怎么运行</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#代码怎么运行"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “代码怎么运行”</span></a></div><p>先完成<a href="/guides/quickstart/">快速开始</a>的依赖配置。每段 Kotlin 可独立放进 <code>fun main()</code>，生成的 <code>png</code> 是图片字节；最后调用 <code>java.io.File(&quot;comparison.png&quot;).writeBytes(png)</code> 保存。各段共用以下导入（不是独立运行程序）：</p><div class="expressive-code"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/ec.w36nc.css"><script data-cfasync="false" type="module" src="/_astro/ec.0vx5m.js"></script><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="text"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#d6deeb;--1:#403f53">import com.muedsa.snapshot.*</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#d6deeb;--1:#403f53">import com.muedsa.snapshot.widget.*</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#d6deeb;--1:#403f53">import com.muedsa.snapshot.widget.text.*</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#d6deeb;--1:#403f53">import com.muedsa.snapshot.paint.*</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#d6deeb;--1:#403f53">import com.muedsa.snapshot.paint.text.*</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#d6deeb;--1:#403f53">import com.muedsa.snapshot.paint.decoration.*</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#d6deeb;--1:#403f53">import com.muedsa.snapshot.paint.gradient.*</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#d6deeb;--1:#403f53">import com.muedsa.snapshot.rendering.flex.*</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#d6deeb;--1:#403f53">import com.muedsa.geometry.*</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#d6deeb;--1:#403f53">import org.jetbrains.skia.paragraph.PlaceholderAlignment</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="import com.muedsa.snapshot.*import com.muedsa.snapshot.widget.*import com.muedsa.snapshot.widget.text.*import com.muedsa.snapshot.paint.*import com.muedsa.snapshot.paint.text.*import com.muedsa.snapshot.paint.decoration.*import com.muedsa.snapshot.paint.gradient.*import com.muedsa.snapshot.rendering.flex.*import com.muedsa.geometry.*import org.jetbrains.skia.paragraph.PlaceholderAlignment"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="图片适配-boxfit" __collectHeading="true">图片适配 BoxFit</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#图片适配-boxfit"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “图片适配 BoxFit”</span></a></div><p><img src="/examples/box-fit-comparison.png" alt="同一张双色源图在七种 BoxFit 模式下的实际效果"/></p><p>源图为 <code>160×80</code>，目标框为 <code>110×110</code>，灰色区域表示没有被源图覆盖。FILL 改变宽高比；COVER 裁掉左右部分；CONTAIN / FIT_WIDTH 完整显示；本例 FIT_HEIGHT 与 COVER 相似，SCALE_DOWN 与 CONTAIN 相似，NONE 按自然逻辑尺寸显示中间部分。这些相似关系会随源图和目标框比例改变。</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="kotlin"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">val</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> png </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">SnapshotImage</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Row</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">        </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Container</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(width </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">80f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, height </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">80f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, color </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">0xFF0369A1</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">toInt</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(), alignment </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> BoxAlignment.CENTER) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">            </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Text</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D">"A"</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, style </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">TextStyle</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(fontSize </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">36f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, color </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">0xFFFFFFFF</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">toInt</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">()))</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">        </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">        </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Container</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(width </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">80f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, height </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">80f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, color </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">0xFFF59E0B</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">toInt</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(), alignment </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> BoxAlignment.CENTER) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">            </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Text</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D">"B"</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, style </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">TextStyle</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(fontSize </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">36f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, color </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">0xFF0F172A</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">toInt</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">()))</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">        </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">use</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> { source </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">-></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">SnapshotPNG</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">        </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Padding</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(padding </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> EdgeInsets.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">all</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">16f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">)) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">            </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Column</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(mainAxisSize </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> MainAxisSize.MIN, crossAxisAlignment </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> CrossAxisAlignment.START) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">                </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">for</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> (group </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">in</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">listOf</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">                    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">listOf</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(BoxFit.FILL, BoxFit.CONTAIN, BoxFit.COVER, BoxFit.FIT_WIDTH),</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">                    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">listOf</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(BoxFit.FIT_HEIGHT, BoxFit.NONE, BoxFit.SCALE_DOWN),</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">                </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">)) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">                    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Row</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(mainAxisSize </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> MainAxisSize.MIN) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">                        </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">for</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> (fit </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">in</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> group) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">                            </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Padding</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(padding </span><span style="--0:#